    LLM: 'Game: Watten. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Watten is an Alpine trick-taking game from Bavaria/Tyrol. 4 players in 2 teams. 32-card German deck. 5 cards each. Features trump SUIT + trump RANK (Schlag). Rechte (both suit+rank) = highest. Linke (other 3 of Schlag rank) are also top trumps. Criticals: Maxi (K♥), Belli (7♦), Spitz (7♣). NO obligation to follow suit. Secret partner signaling ALLOWED.',
    objective: 'Win at least three of the five tricks in each hand to score points; the first team to reach 11 (or 15) cumulative points wins the game.',
    gameplay: 'Choose Schlag (trump rank) and trump suit. Rechte (Schlag+suit) = top. Linke (other 3 Schlag) = next. Criticals: Maxi(K♥), Belli(7♦), Spitz(7♣) = permanent top trumps. NO suit obligation. Signaling between partners ALLOWED. Raising stakes possible (fold or accept).',
